    "text": "We came for sushi and stayed for more. 🍣\n\nAt @fathenryberlin, the best seat is at the chef’s bar: fish torched to order, plates built one by one, the whole kitchen moving in front of you.\n\nHalfway through dinner, a smell too good to ignore made us ask the chef what it was. A new sauce he was still working on, and he added it to our lobster sandwich. Exactly why we’d sit at the counter again.\n\nOur favourite? The tuna ponzu. Rich, full of flavour, and the first thing we’d order next time.\n\nTip: sit at the chef’s bar and ask what’s cooking.\nTested by us. Nothing paid for.\n\n📍 Fat Henry, Joachimstraße 7, Berlin-Mitte\n\n#nuamaedit #berlinsushi #berlinmitte #berlinrestaurants #berlinfood",
